{"title":"Gas Prices Near Me: Are State Gas-Tax Breaks Reaching Your Pump?","description":"The search for gas prices near me has a timely U.S. policy angle: October 5 reporting describes falling prices in some states suspending fuel taxes. Forbes separately reported gasoline above $4 nationwide that day, making local relief worth examining without assuming every station passes along the same savings.\n\nFor entertainment and informational purposes only. This is not financial, legal, medical, or other professional advice. Consult a qualified professional about your circumstances. We are not responsible for decisions or results based on this video.\n\n#GasPricesNearMe #GasPrices #GasStationNearMe #gaspricestoday #USgasolineprices","tags":["gas prices near me","gas prices today","US gasoline prices","gas tax holiday","state gas tax suspension","gas tax relief","gas prices by state","why gas prices vary","gas station prices","gasoline tax savings"],"fallback_query":"American gas station gasoline pump prices","frame":"classic","frame_color":"#2b87e9","voice_id":"iP95p4xoKVk53GoZ742B","voice_gender":"male","music_mood":"light rhythmic instrumental groove, warm keys, crisp soft percussion, curious and approachable, steady moderate energy, no ominous tension, no sirens or trailer impacts","sfx":true,"voice_provider":"elevenlabs","audio_provider":"elevenlabs","reporter_on":false,"hook":"A gasoline-tax suspension doesn't guarantee an equal drop at your pump.","reporter_prompt":"Horizontal on-location opening at an American gas station, with gasoline dispensers and a car being refueled clearly visible behind a middle-aged American male reporter wearing a blue polo. Natural morning lighting, warm curiosity, conversational delivery, no dramatic news-anchor styling. Keep the actual station full-bleed. Reserve upper space for an editorial key-fact overlay, a separate lower band for short mixed-case captions with subtle dark backing and word highlights, and a compact logo be","scen